OL,3,T///,/,-.,./,,-,-,-.-.,-.,/-.-.,.,.,,///
OL,4,CPip benefit system 'not fit for        
OL,5,Cpurpose' and 'dehumanising'            
OL,6,Cassessments should change, review finds
OL,7,GThe system behind the Pip disability   
OL,8,Gbenefit in England and Wales is "not   
OL,9,Gfit for purpose" and often             
OL,10,G"dehumanising" for disabled people, a  
OL,11,Greview finds - what else does it say?. 
OL,13,FThe government says it'll immediately  
OL,14,Fadopt two recommendations: quicker     
OL,15,Fpayments for people with the most      
OL,16,Fsevere conditions and terminal         
OL,17,Fillnesses, and reducing "unnecessary"  
OL,18,Freviews for some with lifelong         
OL,19,Fconditions.                            
OL,22,                                   G1/3 
