OL,3,T///,/,-.,./,,-,-,-.-.,-.,/-.-.,.,.,,///
OL,4,CPip benefit system 'not fit for        
OL,5,Cpurpose' and 'dehumanising'            
OL,6,Cassessments should change, review finds
OL,7,FThe report doesn't recommend how to    
OL,8,Fsave money on the benefit, the cost of 
OL,9,Fwhich is projected to more than double 
OL,10,Fbetween 2020 and 2030 - BBC Verify     
OL,11,Flooks at the numbers.                  
OL,13,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch says 
OL,14,Fthe government has "no plans to cut    
OL,15,Fwelfare" and wants to keep "taxing     
OL,16,Feverybody else" - see how other        
OL,17,Fparties and charities have responsed.  
OL,22,                                   G2/3 
